GEM/2026/B/7918387,"20 KVA Online UPS, Supply, Installation, Testing & Commissioning","Description of Work & Materials Supply, Installation, Testing & Commissioning (SITC) of 20 kVA Online UPS (3-Phase Input 1-Phase Output) along with 20 Nos. Exide SMF Batteries (42 Ah), Battery Rack with Interconnecting Links, required Power Cables, On-site Installation & Commissioning, Standard OEM Warranty and 2 Years Battery Warranty. Scope of Work and Materials The scope of work shall include Supply, Installation, Testing, Commissioning and Demonstration (SITC) of the complete UPS and associated electrical installation system, including all necessary electrical works, materials, accessories, hardware, consumables and manpower required for successful completion and operation of the system. The work and materials shall include, but shall not be limited to, the following: 1, Supply, installation, testing and commissioning of 20 kVA Online UPS (3-Phase Input 1- Phase Output). 2, Supply and installation of 20 Nos. Exide SMF Batteries, 42 Ah. 3, Supply and installation of Battery Rack with all required interconnecting links and accessories. 4; Supply, laying, dressing and termination of required Power Cables. 5; Supply and installation of Distribution Panel (DP), as required. 6; Supply, laying and termination of Armoured Cables of suitable size. 7; Supply and installation of Electrical Distribution Board (DB). 8, Supply and installation of MCCB, MCB, Busbar and required protection devices. 9, Supply and installation of Cable Tray, wherever required. 10, Supply and installation of PVC Conduit Trunking and related accessories. 11; Cable laying, routing, dressing, glanding and termination. 12, Supply of Cable Glands, Lugs, Ferrules, Connectors and Termination Accessories. 13, Supply and installation of Earthing arrangement, including required earthing materials and accessories. 14, Supply and installation of required Switchgear, Hardware, Supports, Fasteners and Accessories. 15, All required electrical wiring, interconnections and associated electrical installation work. 16, All required testing, commissioning and demonstration of the complete system. 17, On-site installation and commissioning by qualified authorized personnel. 18, Supply of all required consumables, miscellaneous materials and accessories necessary for complete installation and successful operation. 19, Rectification of any installation-related defects observed during testing and commissioning. 20, Provision of Standard OEM Warranty for UPS and 2 Years Warranty for Batteries. Note: The bidder shall include the cost of all required materials, labour, transportation, installation, testing, commissioning, tools, tackles, consumables, accessories and other incidental works necessary for complete and satisfactory execution of the work. No additional payment shall be made for any material or work required for successful commissioning and operation of the system but not specifically mentioned above, subject to the approved scope and specifications",Category not available on GeM for the text string uploaded by the buyer,Online UPS (>10 KVA) With Battery,Online UPS (>10 KVA) With Battery,Weak — review,66%
